Output ../assets/demo/search.gif
Output ../assets/demo/search.mp4
Source tapes/settings.tape

Hide
Type "clear && beepertui" Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Sleep 800ms
# / in a chat searches that chat and jumps to the match
Type "/"
Sleep 500ms
Type "gradient"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 2s
# scrolling onto your own messages shows who saw them
Up@500ms 3
Sleep 1.5s
# the : palette lists every command as you type
Type ":"
Sleep 2s
Type "re"
Sleep 2s
Down@400ms 2
Sleep 1s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
